<h3><u>Deke Sar Shabbir Ne</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><span class=""Apple-style-span""  large; "">(Ya Hussein) x4</span><br></p><span class=""Apple-style-span""  'Times New Roman'; line-height: normal; font-size: medium; ""><font size=""4""><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x3</p><ol><li>(Karbala ko jiske sajde) x2 ne mu-alla kardiya</li><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><li>Hashr tak koi yazidi sar utha sakta nahi, jiska badla zindagi bhar deen jukaa sakta nahi, (fatema ke laal ne) x2 ehsaan aisa kardiya</li><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><p>Karbala ko jiske sajde, ne mu-alla kardiya</p><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><li>Teri qurbani se pehle deen ko aaya na chain, ambiya se bhi mukammil jo naho paaya hussein, (ek sajde ne tere woh) x2 kaam pura kardiya</li><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><p>Karbala ko jiske sajde, ne mu-alla kardiya</p><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><li>Aaj bhi naagaah wafaaen hai tere abbas par, nehr par ghazi ke dono kat gaye baazu magar, (taa abad islaam ke) x2 parcham ko uncha kardiya</li><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><p>Karbala ko jiske sajde, ne mu-alla kardiya</p><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><li>Maar kar ibne ali ko cheeni zainab ki ridaa, jab parha kalma nabi kaa phir sare karbobala, (aale ehmad ke liye) x2 yu(n) hashr barpaa kardiya</li><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><p>Karbala ko jiske sajde, ne mu-alla kardiya</p><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><li>Naazon se noke sinaa pe ubhraa thaa ""Jawaad"" jo, kaise bhulegaa zamana fatema ke chaand ko, (sar kataake usne apna) x2 yu(n) ujaala kardiya</li></ol><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p><p>Karbala ko jiske sajde, ne mu-alla kardiya</p><p>(Deke sar shabbir ne, islaam zindaa kardiya) x2</p></font></span></p>
                 